    "AI Notes": {
      "value": "Music and audio specialist, London, 15+ years. Founder of GETME! (thisisgetme.com, est. 2006): a club night turned music/audio agency delivering bespoke sound for brands, publishers and artists. Background includes A&R at Warner Music and music/culture programming for Mixcloud. Brand and client work spans Nike, Dr Martens, Carhartt WIP, Soho House, W Hotels, Soundboks, Skype, Tiger Beer, War Child. Capability: sound design (composition and music for media). Audio work embedded (SoundCloud, NTS show) since his output is sound, not images; site images are event/release visuals. Named case studies exist at alexhislop.com/home/<project> for a deeper image pass later. Instagram @thisislixo. Work Status: Studio/independent (runs GETME); site is self-maintained and current.",
